{
  "key": 19847,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! Um… hi. Sorry. I don’t really\n",
        "get visitors.\r",
        "…Wait. You’re one of Professor\n",
        "Oak’s gym candidates, right?\r",
        "I read about the new gym. A whole\n",
        "gym built around one type…\r",
        "That’s… actually really cool.\n",
        "Like a perfectly optimized build.\r",
        "You know what’d be perfect for a\n",
        "gym trainer? Eevee.\r",
        "It can evolve into a Pokémon of\n",
        "any type. Every type. It’s like\f",
        "the ultimate wildcard.\r",
        "You can find them on Route 1, just\n",
        "south of here. They’re rare, though.\r",
        "If you bring me one, I’ll tell you\n",
        "how it evolves into your gym’s type.\r",
        "…Promise."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_PlushNew",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a Valyreon plush.\r",
        "…Valyreon? It looks like an Eevee\n",
        "evolution you’ve never seen before!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_Plush",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s an Eevee-family plush.\n",
        "It’s super soft."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_AnotherEevee",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, another Eevee!\r",
        "Do you want to know how Eevee\n",
        "evolves into another type?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_WhichType",
      "en_US": "Which type?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_YouFoundOne",
      "en_US": [
        "Is that… an Eevee? You found one!\r",
        "Can I… um, can I see it for a sec?\r",
        "…So fluffy. Okay. Okay, focus.\n",
        "A deal’s a deal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_ComeBackLater",
      "en_US": [
        "Once you’ve got a gym of your own,\n",
        "bring me another Eevee.\r",
        "I’ll help you with the other types\n",
        "too. …If you want."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_NotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "How’s your Eevee doing?\r",
        "When the gym’s yours, come back\n",
        "with another one. I’ll be here.\f",
        "I’m always here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_BringAnother",
      "en_US": [
        "A real Gym Leader… that’s so cool.\r",
        "Bring me another Eevee, and I’ll\n",
        "tell you how it evolves into any\f",
        "type you want."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_Maybe",
      "en_US": "Okay. Maybe later, then."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_Already",
      "en_US": [
        "I already gave you that one. Have\n",
        "Eevee use or hold the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "It’ll become {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_ForThisType",
      "en_US": [
        "For a {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}-type gym, you want\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}. Here, take this."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_HowHold",
      "en_US": [
        "Have your Eevee hold the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} and level it up.\r",
        "That’s it. It’ll evolve into\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}. Easy."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_StillLooking",
      "en_US": [
        "Still looking for an Eevee?\r",
        "Route 1, in the tall grass. They’re\n",
        "rare, so… don’t give up, okay?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_HowFairy",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} doesn’t need an item.\r",
        "Your Eevee has to really trust you,\n",
        "and know a {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}-type move.\r",
        "Then just level it up. That’s the\n",
        "whole trick."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_BagFull",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh… your Bag’s full. Come back when\n",
        "you’ve made some room, okay?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_ViridianCity_PennysHouse_Text_HowUse",
      "en_US": [
        "Use the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} on your\n",
        "Eevee, and it’ll evolve into\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} right away."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0860_CV_CANVAS_VIRIDIAN_PENNYS_HOUSE_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
